{{High Risk|Template:Deleted media|nocat=1|pagetype=Main}}
Adds a compact "Deleted" badge to song list entries, marking a video that is no longer available. Optionally shows the platform icon for the site the video was deleted from. See {{T|Privated media}} for videos that still exist but are private.

==Syntax==
{{T|Deleted media|v1=site =}}

==Examples==
* {{T|Deleted media|_Y_=1}}
* {{T|Deleted media|_Y_=1|p1=site = yt}}
* {{T|Deleted media|_Y_=1|p1=site = nnd}}

Used in a full song list line:
<pre>* "Song Name" {{yt|ABC123}} {{nnd|DEF456}} (description) (2024.01.25) {{Deleted media|site=yt}}</pre>
* "Song Name" {{yt|ABC123}} {{nnd|DEF456}} (description) (2024.01.25) {{Deleted media|site=yt}}

